@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "装配处\n(main.ts / PluginLoader)" as Assembler
participant PluginHost
participant "StagingContext\n(暂存区)" as Staging
participant Plugin
participant "各注册表\nShapeFactory / CommandRegistry\nAttributeHandlerRegistry / TreeDecoratorRegistry" as Registries

Assembler -> PluginHost : install(plugin, manifest, options)
PluginHost -> PluginHost : validateManifest(manifest)\n（失败：manifest mismatch）
PluginHost -> Staging : new
PluginHost -> Plugin : activate(staging, options)
Plugin -> Staging : registerShape / registerCommand /\nregisterAttributeHandler / registerTreeDecorator
note right of Staging : 只是暂存；内核此时看不到
PluginHost -> Staging : close()\n之后再 register 就抛错
alt activate 抛错
  PluginHost --> Assembler : plugin failed to activate: <name> (<reason>)\n暂存区被丢弃
end
PluginHost -> PluginHost : checkManifest(manifest, staging)\n声明 == 实际注册？
alt 不一致
  PluginHost --> Assembler : plugin manifest mismatch: <name> (…)
end
PluginHost -> PluginHost : checkDuplicates(staging)\n与已提交、与暂存内部都不得重名
alt 重名
  PluginHost --> Assembler : duplicate registration: <category>/<name>
end
PluginHost -> Registries : commit：一次性登记全部暂存项
PluginHost -> PluginHost : 带 onDocumentEvent 的装饰器\n同时 session.subscribe
PluginHost --> Assembler : 成功
@enduml
